<title>SWITZERLAND: Alusuisse 1996 profit up 8.0 pct.</title>
<headline>Alusuisse 1996 profit up 8.0 pct.</headline>
<dateline>ZURICH 1997-02-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31, 1996</p>
<p>				    (million Sfr unless stated)</p>
<p> Group net			417		 vs 385</p>
<p> Dividend, Sfr		  18.75	     vs 18.75</p>
<p> Turnover			 8,044	     vs 7,490</p>
<p> Operating income	     702		 vs 651</p>
<p> Cash flow			926		 vs 758</p>
<p> Net debt			 1,948	     vs 1,174</p>
<p> Earnings per share, Sfrs   68		  vs 63</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of the Swiss aluminium, packaging and chemicals group is Alusuisse-Lonza Holding AG.</p>
<p>-- Zurich Newsroom, +41-1-631 7340</p>
